The *.astc and *.rgba files in this directory are output of the astcenc 5.7.1 release binary
(https://github.com/ARM-software/astc-encoder, licence Apache-2.0), run unmodified as a black box on
synthetic images generated by tools/gen_vectors.py (the images in src/ carry no third-party
content). The URL of the release zip and the sha256 of the zip and of the binary are in
../../PROVENANCE.md.

*.astc : astcenc's compressed output (compression).
*.rgba : astcenc's decompression of that file, width*height*4 bytes of RGBA8.

No astcenc source code or binary is included here, and the licence text of the tool is not copied
here. Whether Apache-2.0 section 4 requires it to be shipped with output of this kind is an open
question for the maintainers (../../maintainer-question.md, item 13).
